# with one SET line in chunk 3 switched on at a time.
@h3 ref2va 2:3 0.6MP
style: live-action, TikTok reel
context: 22
refmods: at 1 from 35%

CAST
EMMA (refmod ela4_refMod_Video, image 1): a skinny and pretty alternative young woman around 20 years old.

CHUNK 1
SHOT 7s: static
LORA:<lora:relim_v2_lora_500:0.50>
SEND: frame 30 to image 1
EMMA is showcasing her outfit. EMMA is wearing __80s/80s_women_clothing_combined__ and has __80s/80s_women_hair_combined__ in __80s/colors/80s_colors__ for a 80's party she is going. After 3s someone is ringing at the door and EMMA goes looking and is leaving the scene to the side and is completely out of frame after 5s. After 5s the camera is filming an empty room.
HANDOFF: the camera is filming only the room.

CHUNK 2
SHOT 5s: static
The camera is filming a room. nothing is happening.
HANDOFF: the camera is filming only the room.

CHUNK 3
SHOT 7s: static
# A: neither: a woman as the text describes her, not EMMA
SET: image_1(0), ela4_refMod_Video(0)
